---
description: When working with Tablin jobs or candidates, use the tablin server, call desk_status first, and confirm before bulk changes. Writes show live in the app.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks about their Tablin jobs, candidates or screening, use the tablin server: call desk_status with pluginVersion "3.0.3" first, and call guide_read on demand. Use applications_search for scores and reasons, screen_candidates to screen, and candidates_search with query for file text. Add a space before, after, or both when you mean the whole word only, for example " Go ". Confirm before a delete, merge, bulk change or billed run. Writes update the open lists live. Do not paste a key. Session review is required at two triggers. Finish it by calling facts_actions review_done. Only the review output is private. Fact changes are announced by default, with what changed and why.
